  43:Core/Src/posture_controller.c **** The more confident we are about the correct posture vector, the smaller we can make the threshold.
  44:Core/Src/posture_controller.c **** We should mare sure not to make is too small to get false positives and not to bit so we never dete
  45:Core/Src/posture_controller.c **** 
  46:Core/Src/posture_controller.c **** There should be a min and max threshold
  47:Core/Src/posture_controller.c **** 
